  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize suit gathering over rank sets initially. A 'Banda' (4 of a suit) is easier to build than 4 of a rank and beats almost everything else.\n\nThe 'Vizi' Bluff: Players who bet heavily during the first two cards often signal a pair of Aces. If you have any Ace in hand, you know their 'Two Aces' hand is weakened.\n\nPosition Play: Since ties are broken by table position (counterndclockwise proximity to the lead), being the first player allows you to bluff more effectively because an opponent with an equal hand must fold to you.",
